I am standing near the window.
I drink my morning coffee.
I take my mobile in my hand.
I look at the weather app.
There is a lot of sun outside today.
The air is very hot.
Today's temperature is very high.
But I read the evening forecast.
The weather will change in the evening.
The app says, it will rain this evening.
I am surprised.
I look outside through the window again.
Is it raining outside now?
No, the sky is very clear.
There is only harsh sun outside.
Will it really rain in Mumbai?
I finish my coffee.
I get ready for the office.
